Hi Jeremy,

You should also subset the dissimilarity matrix seq.om, and since the maximum distance in seq.om[clust1,clust1] is less than the maximum in the whole matrix you have to give explicitly the maximum distance.
With:

seqrplot(mvad.seq[clust1,], dist.matrix = seq.om[clust1,clust1], dmax=max(seq.om), border = NA)

you get the same solution for the first cluster.

Best.
Gilbert

